\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">年齢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねんれい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">年龄；年岁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"89604\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>同<rp>(</rp><rt>おな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じくらいの<ruby>年齢<rp>(</rp><rt>ねんれい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她大约跟我同年纪。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/840746\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">野</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">の</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">田野；平原；（建筑物或物体的）隐蔽内部；野生的（用于动物或植物）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219319\">この<ruby>野<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>バラは<ruby>甘<rp>(</rp><rt>あま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>香<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>放<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这朵野玫瑰散发出甜蜜的香味</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ノイローゼ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">神经官能症；神经衰弱；心理问题；身份认同危机；执念</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja